    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# PROJECT: Sentiment Analysis on Social Media Data (Codveda Internship)\n",
    "\n",
    "PROBLEM FORMULATION:\n",
    "Classify social media posts into sentiment categories to gauge public opinion.\n",
    "The main challenge is processing noisy, unstructured text with emojis and hashtags.\n",
    "\n",
    "RECOMMENDATIONS:\n",
    "1. The current TF-IDF + Naive Bayes pipeline is a strong, fast baseline.\n",
    "2. For production, consider upgrading to transformer-based models (e.g., DistilBERT).\n",
    "3. Address class imbalance by collecting more data for underrepresented emotions.\n"
   ]
  },
